Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:34:49 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Fix streaming download lifecycle and add regression coverage

Clean up sessions on cancellation, interruption, download destruction, extension unload, and shutdown. Settle pending writes safely and cover data integrity, ownership, backpressure, and invalid calls.
